# fixedbugs, defect 2061, lane b17-ffi, 2026-10-14.
#
# SYMPTOM: `#define nowhere nosuch_fn`, nothing declaring `nosuch_fn`: told
# `ffi_return_type`, *`nowhere` returns `int`*, a false message: the `int` is
# the result C gives a call to a function it never saw declared.
